ols including a vision-modality replication isolate the cause to instance normalization, and the diagnosis predicts a verified \emph{Frozen Paradox}: frozen adapters beat full fine-tuning by $12$--$79\%$. Applying the same raw-signal principle at the expert level (Residual-IA\textsuperscript{+}) closes the remaining gap to per-dataset supervised baselines.
